      "graphic": {
        "chapter": "Look what you can do now",
        "text": "Our goal was to connect mixed numbers and improper fractions. You can build wholes, count the leftover parts, and convert in either direction. Before calculating, what would your amount look like? Try drawing it, then practise on Math Magic.",
        "role": "recap",
        "equation": null,
